<line>System;<title>Spearman's rank correlation</title></line>
<line></line>
<line><in>sample_1</in> vs. <in>sample_2</in></line>
<line>Observations per sample = <in>obs</in></line>
<line>Spearman's score = <in>ix</in></line>
<line></line>
<line>Spearman's rank correlation coefficient (Rho) =  <in>rho</in></line>
<line><block name="noci"></line>
<line><warnabit>CI not calculated when rho is 1 or -1.</warnabit></block><block name="ci"></line>
