<line><warnabit>P not calculable</warnabit></block><block name="results"></line>
<line></line>
<line><ci>Upper side <in>p_u</in></ci>  (H<sub>1</sub>: positive correlation)</line>
<line><ci>Lower side <in>p_l</in></ci>  (H<sub>1</sub>: negative correlation)</line>
<line><ci>Two sided <in>p_2</in></ci>  (H<sub>1</sub>: any correlation)</block></block><block name="ties"></line>
